      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just can't stop thinking about it. that kid in the hallway, months ago... i just stood there. i watched them get cornered and i did nothing. i even felt this weird sense of relief that it wasn't me. i feel like there's just something fundamentally broken in my core. like i'm just a bad person masquerading as a human.",
