    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "kindness? i dont think i want kindness. i think i just want the rot to stop. it's like i'm a parasite. everyone else is out here actually living, and i'm just... taking up oxygen that could be going to someone who isn't a coward. i don't see how i'm supposed to just \"be kind\" to someone who's essentially a hollow, selfish shell.",
